08005ddc <HAL_NVIC_SetPriorityGrouping>:
  * @note   When the NVIC_PriorityGroup_0 is selected, IRQ preemption is no more possible. 
  *         The pending IRQ priority will be managed only by the subpriority. 
  * @retval None
